<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/client_transactions/amount> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: fact
description: 'The rupee consideration, always stored positive, Redemption rows included.
  amount ~= units * nav_price holds on all 3,004 rows to within rounding (max relative
  difference < 0.001%). Direction is carried only by transaction_type, never by the
  sign of this column: net flow = SUM(CASE WHEN transaction_type=''Redemption'' THEN
  -amount ELSE amount END); turnover = SUM(amount) over both directions. Summing amount
  without a transaction_type filter therefore adds redemptions to purchases.'
display_name: Amount
filterable: true
name: amount
nullable: true
sql_type: double precision
type: float
""" .

