<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_mf_nav_history/nav_currency> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: Implies multi-currency capability (offshore/feeder funds). Overwhelmingly
  INR for an India-domiciled book. Nullable with NO default, so a NULL currency is
  indistinguishable from INR - any cross-currency aggregation must handle that explicitly.
