  dim_mf_nav_history and dim_mf_returns_history - four tables carry it.
display_name: Category
filterable: true
name: category
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/co_code> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: 'Equity data vendor company code -> dim_cmot_company_mstr.co_code. WARNING:
  the same column name in dim_cmot_index_prices identifies an INDEX, not a company.
  Populated on 30 of 98 rows: all 25 Direct Equity products (every one matches dim_cmot_company_mstr.co_code),
  plus 3 REITs (1050, 1051, 1052) and 2 InvITs (1053, 1054), whose codes do NOT appear
  in the supplied company master. Blank for every other product type. Whether those
  five codes should reference dim_cmot_company_mstr (company export incomplete) or
  another table is not stated by the source and must be confirmed with the data team.
  Preserve each original co_code; leave the five unmatched - do not invent company
  records or guess another target.'
display_name: Company Code
filterable: true
join_target: dim_cmot_company_mstr.co_code
name: co_code
nullable: true
sql_type: integer
type: integer
warning: co_code identifies an INDEX in dim_cmot_index_prices
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/company_name> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: The issuer; meaningful for equity.
display_name: Company Name
filterable: true
name: company_name
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/credit_rating> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: Cached copy. DUPLICATED from dim_product_credit_rtng, which is INFERRED
  to be the source of record. Read the specialist table for risk and compliance reporting;
  reconcile the two and alert on mismatches.
display_name: Credit Rating
duplicated_from: dim_product_credit_rtng.credit_rating
filterable: true
name: credit_rating
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/display_name> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: The UI-facing label. The schema documentation does not define how it
  differs from instrument_name.
display_name: Display Name
filterable: true
name: display_name
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/face_value> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: fact
description: Duplicated from dim_product_credit_rtng. Typed integer, so it CANNOT
  represent a fractional face value.
display_name: Face Value
duplicated_from: dim_product_credit_rtng.face_value
filterable: true
name: face_value
nullable: true
sql_type: integer
type: integer
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/instrument_name> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: The formal instrument name - the one the fact tables denormalise. One
  of three overlapping name columns here.
display_name: Instrument Name
filterable: true
name: instrument_name
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/interest_rate> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: fact
description: Coupon rate. Duplicated from dim_product_credit_rtng.
display_name: Interest Rate
duplicated_from: dim_product_credit_rtng.interest_rate
filterable: true
name: interest_rate
nullable: true
sql_type: real
type: float
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/is_active> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: Nullable three-valued flag.
display_name: Is Active
filterable: true
name: is_active
nullable: true
sql_type: boolean
three_valued: true
type: boolean
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/is_deleted> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: Nullable three-valued flag.
display_name: Is Deleted
filterable: true
name: is_deleted
nullable: true
sql_type: boolean
three_valued: true
type: boolean
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/is_etf> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: Boolean, nullable and three-valued.
display_name: Is ETF
filterable: true
name: is_etf
nullable: true
sql_type: boolean
three_valued: true
type: boolean
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/is_listed> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: 'Declared character varying(256): a text field, unlike its neighbours
  is_etf, is_active and is_deleted, which are booleans. Observed values: ''Listed''
  (72 rows) and ''Unlisted'' (26 rows); no blanks. Filter on the text (is_listed =
  ''Listed''); a bare ''WHERE is_listed'' does not apply to a text column. The is_
  prefix does not make it a Boolean - keep the string datatype and the original values.'
display_name: Is Listed
filterable: true
name: is_listed
nullable: true
observed_values:
- Listed
- Unlisted
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/isin> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: International Securities Identification Number - the one identifier that
  spans every asset class and every vendor table (present in 11 tables). Take ISIN
  from HERE rather than from a fact row. NOT unique in dim_equity_price_latest, whose
  grain includes exchange.
display_name: ISIN
filterable: true
name: isin
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/maturity_date> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: time_dimension
description: Duplicated from dim_product_credit_rtng.
display_name: Maturity Date
duplicated_from: dim_product_credit_rtng.maturity_date
filterable: true
name: maturity_date
nullable: true
sql_type: date
type: date
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/mstar_id> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: Morningstar identifier -> dim_mf_fund_complete.mstar_id. MUTUAL FUNDS
  ONLY. This is the crosswalk that reaches the NAV and returns history.
display_name: Morningstar ID
filterable: true
join_target: dim_mf_fund_complete.mstar_id
name: mstar_id
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/nse_symbol> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: NSE trading symbol - alphabetic ticker, e.g. RELIANCE. Text, unlike bse_symbol.
display_name: NSE Symbol
filterable: true
name: nse_symbol
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/product_id> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: THE UNIVERSAL PRODUCT KEY and the reason this table exists - it gives
  every investable instrument one key regardless of asset class. Referenced by 5 fact
  tables plus dim_product_segment_map. Format is type-prefixed and human-readable
  (PROD_EQ_001, PROD_MF_010), but filter on product_type rather than parsing the string.
display_name: Product ID
filterable: true
name: product_id
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/product_short_code> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: Internal short code.
display_name: Product Short Code
filterable: true
name: product_short_code
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/product_type> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: 'THE ROUTING DISCRIMINATOR that decides which specialist dimension is
  valid to join onward to. Observed values (98 rows): Mutual Funds (30), Direct Equity
  (25), Bonds (15), Fixed Deposits (10), AIF (8), PMS (5), REITs (3), InvITs (2) -
  the fixed-income types the schema documentation samples omitted are present.'
display_name: Product Type
filterable: true
name: product_type
nullable: true
observed_values:
- Mutual Funds
- Direct Equity
- Bonds
- Fixed Deposits
- AIF
- REITs
- PMS
- InvITs
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/row_hash> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: 64-bit change-detection fingerprint; samples are 16 lowercase hex chars.
  Used for change-detecting upsert. Present in all 14 dim_* tables, none of the client_*
  facts. NEVER join on this.
display_name: Row Hash
filterable: false
hidden: true
name: row_hash
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/rta_code> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: Registrar & Transfer Agent scheme code (CAMS/KFin). MUTUAL FUNDS ONLY
  - NULL on equity rows.
display_name: RTA Code
filterable: true
name: rta_code
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/scheme_master_id> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: Internal scheme surrogate key; also present in dim_product_credit_rtng.
  Use this column (not isin) to join to the credit-rating table -- 3 rated instruments
  have isin = 'N/A' and so are missed by an isin join.
display_name: Scheme Master ID
filterable: true
join_target: dim_product_credit_rtng.scheme_master_id
name: scheme_master_id
nullable: true
sql_type: integer
type: integer
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/sector> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: 'Sector as a bare NAME with no code. NAMING TRAP: dim_cmot_company_mstr
  splits the same concept into sector_code + sector_name, giving two representations
  to reconcile. No dim_sector table exists.'
display_name: Sector
filterable: true
missing_dimension: dim_sector
name: sector
naming_trap: dim_cmot_company_mstr splits this into sector_code + sector_name
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/source_load_ts> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: time_dimension
description: ETL load timestamp, WITHOUT TIME ZONE - no timezone is recorded anywhere,
  so IST vs UTC is a convention held outside the DB. Present in 12 of 14 dim_* tables;
  absent from both MF history tables and from all 7 client_* facts.
display_name: Source Load Timestamp
filterable: true
hidden: true
name: source_load_ts
nullable: true
sql_type: timestamp without time zone
type: timestamp
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/source_table> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: 'Lineage: name of the ORIGIN object in the SOURCE system, not this table.
  Proven by dim_client_master rows carrying ''clients''. Present in all 21 tables.
  NEVER join or filter business logic on this.'
display_name: Source Table
filterable: false
hidden: true
name: source_table
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/sub_asset_class> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: dimension
description: Level 2 asset classification name. Not determined by sub_asset_class_id
  - one ID carries several names (see sub_asset_class_id). Blank on 28 rows. Preserve
  as supplied.
display_name: Sub-Asset Class
filterable: true
name: sub_asset_class
nullable: true
sql_type: varchar(256)
type: string
""" .

<https://wealth.example.org/neowealth/declared-attribute/main/dim_product_unified_cat/sub_asset_class_id> a meta:DeclaredAttribute ;
    meta:rawYaml """attribute_type: identifier
description: 'Level 2 asset classification. No backing dimension. NOT A RELIABLE IDENTITY:
  ID 1004 carries several labels - Contra, Dividend Yield, Flexi Cap, FoF Overseas,
  Focused and Value under asset_class_id 901 (8 products), and Dynamic Bond, Gilt
  and Liquid under 902 (3 products) - 11 products in all. Adding asset_class_id does
  not resolve it, because several labels remain within each parent. Also, asset_class_id
  903 (''Hybrid'') holds two products: PROD_MF_019 carries sub_asset_class_id 903
  (''Hybrid'') - the same value as its asset_class_id - and PROD_MF_020 carries 1011
  (''Balanced Advantage''). Blank on 28 rows. Keep sub_asset_class_id and sub_asset_class
  together on each product row exactly as supplied; SQL filters and groups use them
  directly. Do not overwrite labels, invent replacement IDs, infer one authoritative
  name per ID, or build a shared category entity on this ID until the data team confirms
  what 1004 means.'
display_name: Sub-Asset Class ID
filterable: true
name: sub_asset_class_id
nullable: true
sql_type: integer
type: integer
""" .

